<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's EDP issues 30 bln esc 15-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Portugal's EDP issues 30 bln esc 15-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EDP-Electricidade de Portugal SA is issuing 30 billion escudos of 15-year bonds indexed to six-month Lisbor minus 12.5 basis points, joint leaders Caixa Geral de Depositos and Banco Nacional Ultramarino said.</p>
<p>The price of the issue is 100 percent, a statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is the possibility either of a put option or a call option on the expiry dates of the 10th and 20th coupons,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The issue will be admitted to Lisbon bourse.</p>
<p>There is an ownership clause.</p>
<p>The guarantee syndicate is presently being formed.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
